<title>USA: MCN Corp Q3 loss widens.</title>
<headline>MCN Corp Q3 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.20     loss	 $0.13</p>
<p> Net loss		  13,403     loss	 8,627</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q3 1995 includes $0.01 a share gain from discontinued operations.  </p>
<p>	  9 MONTHS</p>
